GADM boundary data
==================

Source:   GADM, https://gadm.org (level 2 = district / quận-huyện)
Version:  GADM 4.1 (gadm41_VNM_2.json, Last-Modified 2022-07-20)
URL:      see GADM_SOURCES in app/geo/gadm.py
Fetched:  2026-11-03
License:  GADM data is free for academic and other non-commercial use only and may not be
          redistributed (C11, D19). This project and the web app are non-commercial.

Why the files are not in git
----------------------------
The repository is public, and the GADM license forbids redistribution (D23). Downloaded files
live in data/geo/raw/, which is git-ignored. The `output` schema exposes district/ward names
only, never polygons (C11).

Notes on GADM 4.1
-----------------
- Still pre-2021 for HCMC: Quận 2, Quận 9 and Thủ Đức are separate features, so one file
  fills both legacy_districts (TP Thủ Đức = union of the three) and legacy_sub_areas.
- Names have no spaces ("HồChíMinh", "Quận1", "BìnhThạnh"); the loader restores them
  before alias lookup (gadm_display_name).
- Load result: 22/22 districts, 3/3 sub-areas, all polygons valid.

Commands
--------
    uv run python -m app.geo.gadm fetch [--version 4.1] [--yes]
    uv run python -m app.geo.gadm load --districts data/geo/raw/<file> [--sub-areas <file>]

`load` fills legacy_districts.geom and legacy_sub_areas.geom (Quận 2, Quận 9, Quận Thủ Đức).
If the district file already merges Thủ Đức city (post-2021), sub-area polygons come from a
pre-2021 file passed with --sub-areas (FR-5.6). Re-running `load` overwrites the polygons.
After changing the boundary data, matched mentions must be re-enriched (FR-7.7).

Wards
-----
The `wards` table (post-1/7/2025 commune-level units) has no polygon source yet, so `ward`
stays null (FR-5.2).
